A fantastic ecology enrichment residential trip for our Year 13 students at Nettlecombe Court, Somerset. They investigated moorland, rocky shores and river ecosystems, and practised ethical mammal and insect trapping. Thanks to @field_studies_council and our brilliant instructor, Ed. Looking forward to 2027!
