Our Academy in Pictures
Zara speaks about her decision to stay on at Purley for Sixth Form...
I am originally from the Caribbean, where education and discipline were always highly valued. When moving to the UK, I looked for a school with strong expectations, clear structure, and a genuine commitment to students achieving their best, and HAPU immediately stood out.
Harris Academy Purley is a welcoming and supportive place to work, with a focus on both student and staff wellbeing.
My name is Deja, and I am proud to be Head Girl at Harris Academy Purley.
Compared to other schools I’ve worked in, Purley has a very modern feel about it. The classrooms are large and well presented, this adds to the positive atmosphere.
